      'Kerala is an Android market with high smartphone penetration and uneven networks, and the apps that succeed here are designed for the phone people actually own: small download, fast cold start, offline behaviour in a lift or an estate, and screens that work in Malayalam without breaking the layout. An app designed on the latest iPhone in an office with fibre is designed for a user who does not exist here.',
      'We build cross-platform in React Native or Flutter where that fits and native where the requirements demand it, decided on the facts in discovery. The backend is built on the same engineering practice as our business systems, hosted in Indian regions, integrated with the CRM, ERP, Tally and payment systems the business already runs.',
