          'An alert is only useful if it reaches someone who will act on it, on a channel they will see, with enough information to decide. For most Kerala sites that means a WhatsApp message with a clip to the guard on shift and the manager, an alarm in the control room where there is one, and a door or a light triggered through the existing access control where the site has it. Every event is logged with its clip so the morning review takes minutes and the audit trail exists.',
          'We integrate with the security provider’s process rather than replacing it, and the installer keeps responsibility for the cameras.',
